OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvernight,
OL,6,Fpatchy cloud and mostly clear spells
OL,7,Fare expected across the region,
OL,8,Falthough the odd shower may affect
OL,9,Fcoasts of Cornwall. Temperatures will
OL,10,Ffall away, making for a cool night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAny showers in the west will
OL,13,Ffade, with cloud lifting and breaking
OL,14,Fto leave a dry and sunny day. Sunshine
OL,15,Fmay be hazy at times. Feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
