OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells. Cloud may build at
OL,7,Ftimes later on Monday, but conditions
OL,8,Fwill remain largely dry. Warm on
OL,9,FSaturday, with warm weather continuing
OL,10,Finto early next week.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
